# Copy to .env (gitignored) and adjust locally.
#
# Per CONFIGURATION.md: this file holds *values* only (ports, bootstrap
# servers, topic names, credentials, replica counts, image/build-context
# selection). Structural choices (a dev's own Avro schema directory, a dev's
# own service source) are volume mounts / build-context swaps, not env vars -
# see CONFIGURATION.md for why that split is deliberate.
#
# M0: no services exist yet, so nothing below is consumed by anything yet.
# Real entries are added starting M1 (KAFKA_BOOTSTRAP_SERVERS,
# SCHEMA_REGISTRY_URL) and grow milestone by milestone alongside the compose
# overlays that need them.
